== A6. Day's own figures expressed in the same formula
  Haldane 1/300 = ln R / D at (D=30, R=e^0.1=1.105);  Term 3 0.0256/gen at Ne=3300 = 0.45/(2 ln 6600): equals ln R / D with D = 2 ln 2Ne = 17.6 and ln R = 0.45 (R = 1.57), or d=1: R = e = 2.72
  0.0256 x 252,000 = 6451 ; 1/300 x 252,000 = 840
